sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor U as You
  participant W as Web app
  participant M as Master agent
  participant S as Specialist agents
  participant A as Approval step

  U->>W: "Email Rahul the deck is coming Friday, and Pune weather tomorrow?"
  W->>M: start a run (live stream)
  par in parallel
    M->>S: Email agent: prepare the email
    S-->>M: email PROPOSED (not sent)
  and
    M->>S: Travel agent: weather
    S-->>M: forecast
  end
  M->>A: 1 action needs approval
  A-->>W: answer + approval card
  W-->>U: shows [Approve] [Reject]
  U->>W: Approve
  W->>A: resume with "approved"
  A->>A: send email · log it · update Sheet
  A-->>U: "Sent ✅"
  Note over A: Nothing is sent, changed or deleted<br/>until you approve
